### ========== PUBLIC ==========

### 1. Ping
GET http://localhost:8080/ping

### 2. List movies
GET http://localhost:8080/movies

### 3. List movies by genre
GET http://localhost:8080/movies?genre=ACTION

### 4. List projections
GET http://localhost:8080/projections


### ========== AUTH ==========

### 5. Register CLIENT
POST http://localhost:8080/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "John",
  "lastName": "Doe",
  "birthdate": "2000-01-01",
  "email": "john@test.com",
  "password": "secret123",
  "phone": "0340000000",
  "role": "CLIENT"
}

> {% client.global.set("clientToken", response.body.token); %}

### 6. Register MANAGER
POST http://localhost:8080/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Ann",
  "lastName": "Smith",
  "birthdate": "1990-05-05",
  "email": "ann@test.com",
  "password": "secret123",
  "role": "MANAGER"
}

> {% client.global.set("managerToken", response.body.token); %}

### 7. Login CLIENT (expect 200)
POST http://localhost:8080/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "john@test.com",
  "password": "secret123"
}

> {% client.global.set("clientToken", response.body.token); %}

### 8. Register duplicate email (expect 409)
POST http://localhost:8080/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "John",
  "lastName": "Doe",
  "birthdate": "2000-01-01",
  "email": "john@test.com",
  "password": "secret123",
  "role": "CLIENT"
}

### 9. Login wrong password (expect 403)
POST http://localhost:8080/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "john@test.com",
  "password": "wrong"
}


### ========== RESERVATIONS (CLIENT) ==========

### 10. GET /reservations as CLIENT (expect 403)
GET http://localhost:8080/reservations
Authorization: Bearer {{clientToken}}

### 11. PUT /reservation as CLIENT (expect 403)
PUT http://localhost:8080/reservation
Authorization: Bearer {{clientToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "projectionId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
  "seatId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000"
}

### 12. GET /reservationById as CLIENT on own/nonexistent (expect 404)
GET http://localhost:8080/reservationById/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Authorization: Bearer {{clientToken}}


### ========== RESERVATIONS (STAFF) ==========

### 13. PUT /reservation as MANAGER (expect 200) — replace with real IDs from GET /projections and your DB
PUT http://localhost:8080/reservation
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "projectionId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
  "seatId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000"
}

### 14. GET /reservations as MANAGER (expect 200)
GET http://localhost:8080/reservations
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}

### 15. PUT /reservation update with id (expect 200)
PUT http://localhost:8080/reservation?id=00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "projectionId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
  "seatId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000"
}

### 16. GET /reservationById as MANAGER (expect 200)
GET http://localhost:8080/reservationById/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}
